      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are carrying an immense weight of loss, a crushing realization of what has been shattered. When everything you built crumbles, the silence can feel deafening, echoing the void where purpose used to be. Even in the deepest ruins, there is a quiet strength in simply enduring the cold. Perhaps the story isn't over, but it's time to see what a new, quieter chapter looks like, one that acknowledges the wreckage.",
